.TH "CVM" "5" "2026\-10\-27" "TheCRatTime"
.SH NAME
\fBCVM\fR \- CVM Text Format\&.
.PP
.SH DESCRIPTION
There are all commands:
.PP
\fBmov \fIreg reg_or_num\fR
.RS 4
Set to \fIreg\fR value of \fIreg_or_num\fR\&.
.RE
.PP
\fBadd \fIreg reg_or_num\fR
.RS 4
Add to \fIreg\fR \fIreg_or_num\fR and write to \fIreg\fR\&.
.RE
.PP
\fBsub \fIreg reg_or_num\fR
.RS 4
Subtract from \fIreg\fR \fIreg_or_num\fR and write to \fIreg\fR\&.
.RE
.PP
\fBprint \fIreg\fR
.RS 4
Print value of \fIreg\fR\&.
.RE
.PP
\fBhalt\fR
.RS 4
Interrupt the program\&.
.RE
.PP
\fBnop\fR
.RS 4
Do nothing\&.
.RE
.PP
\fBeof\fR
.RS 4
Specify \fBE\fRnd \fBO\fRf \fBF\fRile\&.
.RE
.PP
\fBeax\fR
.RS 4
Specify register \fBeax\fR
.RE
.PP
\fBebx\fR
.RS 4
Specify register \fBebx\fR
.RE
.PP
\fBinc \fIreg\fR
.RS 4
Add to \fBreg\fR 1\&.
.RE
.PP
\fBdec \fIreg\fR
.RS 4
Subtract from \fBreg\fR 1\&.
.RE
.SH AUTHORS
Project and man\-page: TheCRatTime
.SH SEE ALSO
\fBcvmr\fR(1), \fBcvmc\fR(1), \fBcvmd\fR(1)
